Package: libplugin-hostd-protocol0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: plugin-hostd protocol library, a superset of mod-host's text protocol
 The socket server, line protocol and command dispatch that plugin-hostd and
 omx-clap-host answer their controllers with: mod-host's text protocol, so any
 mod-host client works unchanged.
 .
 Its documentation is on openmixer.org.

Package: libplugin-hostd-protocol-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libplugin-hostd-protocol0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: plugin-hostd protocol library, development files
 Headers, the pkg-config file, the scenario corpus and its runner of
 libplugin-hostd-protocol. The headers have the names and the API of
 libmod-host-protocol's, so a host built against mod-host-protocol changes only
 the package name it asks pkg-config for.
 .
 It also carries the declared protocol: plugin-hostd/protocol.h and the
 headers it includes, the one verb table, the grammar of a line in ABNF, and
 the protocol as JSON, each named by a pkg-config variable.
 .
 Its documentation is on openmixer.org.

Package: plugin-hostd-protocol-contract
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: omx-contract (>= 3.2.0~), omx-contract (<< 4~), ${misc:Depends}
Breaks: plugin-hostd-contract (<< 0.16.0~)
Description: plugin-hostd protocol, its verbs in omx-contract's contract directory
 data/verbs.json of plugin-hostd-protocol, the verbs and reply codes
 plugin-hostd adds to mod-host's protocol, as the package plugin-hostd-protocol
 of omx-contract's contract directory, under
 /usr/share/omx-contract/contract.d/3/plugin-hostd-protocol. plugin-hostd
 before 0.16.0 carried the same items in its own package.
 .
 Its documentation is on openmixer.org.
